      "summaries": {
        "en": "rtk is a CLI proxy that slashes LLM token usage by 60-90% on common developer commands, making AI coding assistants cheaper and faster. It intercepts tool calls, deduplicates context, and caches responses efficiently—all in a single Rust binary with zero dependencies. Developers can drop it into their existing workflow with Claude Code or similar tools to cut costs without sacrificing quality. Ideal for teams running frequent code reviews, refactoring, or debugging sessions.",
        "zh": "rtk 是一个轻量级 CLI 代理，能将常见开发命令中的 LLM token 消耗降低 60-90%，让 AI 编程助手更经济高效。其核心设计在于拦截工具调用、去重上下文并智能缓存响应，所有功能集成在单个 Rust 二进制文件中，无任何外部依赖。开发者只需将其接入 Claude Code 等现有工具，即可在不影响质量的前提下大幅削减成本。特别适合频繁进行代码审查、重构或调试的团队，是优化 AI 辅助开发流程的实用利器。",
        "es": "rtk is a CLI proxy that slashes LLM token usage by 60-90% on common developer commands, making AI coding assistants cheaper and faster. It intercepts tool calls, deduplicates context, and caches responses efficiently—all in a single Rust binary with zero dependencies. Developers can drop it into their existing workflow with Claude Code or similar tools to cut costs without sacrificing quality. Ideal for teams running frequent code reviews, refactoring, or debugging sessions.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "rtk stands out for agentic-coding, ai-coding, and anthropic in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "rtk is a CLI proxy that slashes LLM token usage by 60-90% on common developer commands, making AI coding assistants cheaper and faster. It intercepts tool calls, deduplicates context, and caches responses efficiently—all in a single Rust binary with zero dependencies. Developers can drop it into their existing workflow with Claude Code or similar tools to cut costs without sacrificing quality. Ideal for teams running frequent code reviews, refactoring, or debugging sessions.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/rtk-ai/rtk for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
