        "en": "ViMax is an all-in-one agentic video generation framework that combines director, screenwriter, producer, and video generator roles into a single system. It addresses the challenge of producing coherent, story-driven videos from simple prompts. Technically, it uses a multi-agent architecture where specialized agents handle planning, scripting, and rendering, enabling complex narrative generation. You can experiment with it by providing a text prompt or story outline, and ViMax will autonomously produce a complete video with scene transitions and consistent characters. Ideal for rapid prototyping of video content or educational storytelling.",
        "zh": "ViMax是一个集导演、编剧、制片人和视频生成于一体的智能体视频生成框架，旨在解决从简单提示生成连贯故事视频的难题。其核心技术采用多智能体架构，通过专门化的智能体分别负责剧情规划、脚本编写和画面渲染，实现复杂叙事生成。用户输入文本提示或故事大纲后，ViMax可自动生成包含场景切换和角色一致的完整视频。该工具特别适合快速制作视频原型或教育叙事内容，使非专业用户也能轻松创作高质量视频故事。",
        "es": "ViMax is an all-in-one agentic video generation framework that combines director, screenwriter, producer, and video generator roles into a single system. It addresses the challenge of producing coherent, story-driven videos from simple prompts. Technically, it uses a multi-agent architecture where specialized agents handle planning, scripting, and rendering, enabling complex narrative generation. You can experiment with it by providing a text prompt or story outline, and ViMax will autonomously produce a complete video with scene transitions and consistent characters. Ideal for rapid prototyping of video content or educational storytelling.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "ViMax stands out for agentic-aigc and video-generation in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "ViMax is an all-in-one agentic video generation framework that combines director, screenwriter, producer, and video generator roles into a single system. It addresses the challenge of producing coherent, story-driven videos from simple prompts. Technically, it uses a multi-agent architecture where specialized agents handle planning, scripting, and rendering, enabling complex narrative generation. You can experiment with it by providing a text prompt or story outline, and ViMax will autonomously produce a complete video with scene transitions and consistent characters. Ideal for rapid prototyping of video content or educational storytelling.",
